	| Version       | 7.2                           | |
	| Type          | Production                    | |
	| Host Name     | localhost                     | |
	| IP Addresses  | 123.45.67.89                  | |
	| MAC Addresses | 0A-1B-2C-3D-4E-5F             | |
	| Owner         | Korlic - ${staticProjectName} | |
	| Description   | Korlic - ${staticProjectName} | |
	| Complimentary | No                            | |
	| Status        | ACTIVE                        | |
	| Created By    | Test Test                     | |
	And I should be able to download a "DXP" developer license with version "7.2" on the account "Korlic - ${staticProjectName}"

